# VHS Tape for Tagisan (tgs) Demo Recording
# To render: vhs assets/demo.tape

Output assets/tgs_demo.gif
Output assets/tgs_demo.mp4

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful

Type "tgs --help"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "clear"
Enter

# Demonstrate ECC Skills Hybrid Lexical-Semantic Dispatcher
Type "tgs ecc skills -q 'boids flocking simulation in WebGL'"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "clear"
Enter

# Demonstrate Dialectical Multi-LLM Debate
Type "tgs debate 'PostgreSQL vs MongoDB for high-throughput analytics' --local"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
